  m_text: 'We would like to create a new InputActionMap called "Swimming" to enable
    our character to swim when he enters a water element of specific depth. For this
    reason we''d require certain swimming animation clips (surface only, there will
    be no underwater swimming) that we plan to use in the Animator as follows:'
